!Cheatsheets

Reference documents to help memorize different aspects of Lojban.

The aim of these documents is not to explain each concept in details but, rather, to provide a quick way to recollect memories about lojban concepts.

((IRC cheat sheet))

!!General Concepts

*__Lojban grammar words__. A ''mind map'' of lojban words commonly used when discussing about lojban grammar. It can be handy when you get confused about all those lojban-specific concepts that are described with lojban words (bridi, seltau, ...) [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=759|PNG], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=760|PNG (hi-res)], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=761|Source (Tony Buzan's iMandMap)]

!!Cmavo

*__Space/Time tenses__. A 4 pages booklet with mnemonic illustration. [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=726|PDF], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=727|Source (OpenOffice)]

*__pro-sumti and pro-bridi__. A ''periodic table'' of cmavo. [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=746|PDF], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=747|PNG], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=748|Source (OpenOffice)]

*__Numerics__. A chart of elements of mathematical expressions (mekso). [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=734|PNG], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=735|Source (Inkscape SVG)]

*__Rhetoric__. A table with the cmavo most relevant to communicate effectively and persuasively. Attitudinals, Emotionals, Vocatives, ... One page: [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=915|PDF], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=916|Source (OpenOffice)] Two pages (front back): [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=917|PDF], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=918|Source (OpenOffice)] Four pages (booklet): [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=919|PDF], [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-download_wiki_attachment.php?attId=920|Source (OpenOffice)]


